WEBVTT

1
00:00:11.067 --> 00:00:19.421
Everyone at the TV station was busy.

2
00:00:19.422 --> 00:00:21.831
A woman turned on a camera.

3
00:00:21.832 --> 00:00:24.044
A man carried a microphone.

4
00:00:24.045 --> 00:00:29.824
They were getting ready to film an episode of Mighty Man.

5
00:00:29.825 --> 00:00:36.071
"Where's Mighty Man?" asked someone.

6
00:00:36.072 --> 00:00:40.099
"Here I am," said an actor in a superhero costume.

7
00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:45.423
Suddenly—poof! A man appeared in a puff of smoke.

8
00:00:45.424 --> 00:00:48.448
He had a tall hat and a thin moustache.

9
00:00:48.449 --> 00:00:50.349
He wore a tuxedo.

10
00:00:50.350 --> 00:00:53.489
A monkey sat on his shoulder.

11
00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.860
The man had an evil grin.

12
00:00:55.861 --> 00:01:00.794
"There's going to be a new show today!"

13
00:01:00.795 --> 00:01:03.308
"Hurry up!" said Jack.

14
00:01:03.309 --> 00:01:06.143
"Mighty Man is on in ten minutes!"

15
00:01:06.144 --> 00:01:09.216
Roxy and her friends were on their way to Jack's house.

16
00:01:09.217 --> 00:01:13.974
They were going to watch Mighty Man, a TV show about a superhero.

17
00:01:13.975 --> 00:01:18.402
"I wonder what Mighty Man will do today," said Mara.

18
00:01:18.403 --> 00:01:23.142
"Last week an asteroid was about to crash into Earth," said Jack.

19
00:01:23.143 --> 00:01:27.535
"So today Mighty Man is going to stop it!"

20
00:01:27.536 --> 00:01:31.877
"Mighty Man is so cool," said Mara.

21
00:01:31.878 --> 00:01:34.623
"He's okay," said Terrell.

22
00:01:34.624 --> 00:01:37.307
"But he's not that great."

23
00:01:37.308 --> 00:01:39.827
Jack and Mara were stunned.

24
00:01:39.828 --> 00:01:42.831
"What do you mean?" asked Jack.

25
00:01:42.832 --> 00:01:44.561
Terrell shrugged.

26
00:01:44.562 --> 00:01:46.791
"Mighty Man isn't real.

27
00:01:46.792 --> 00:01:49.550
He's just a character on a show."

28
00:01:49.551 --> 00:01:52.265
"We know that," said Jack.

29
00:01:52.266 --> 00:01:57.090
"But if he was real, he'd be the best superhero ever."

30
00:01:57.091 --> 00:01:59.890
"No way!" said Terrell.

31
00:01:59.891 --> 00:02:04.809
"Rocket Girl is much cooler than Mighty Man! Right, Roxy?"

32
00:02:04.810 --> 00:02:07.345
Everyone looked at Roxy.

33
00:02:07.346 --> 00:02:11.684
"Well?" said Mara. "What do you think, Roxy?"

34
00:02:11.685 --> 00:02:13.948
Roxy thought for a moment.

35
00:02:13.949 --> 00:02:16.747
"I agree with Terrell," she said.

36
00:02:16.748 --> 00:02:20.303
"Rocket Girl is definitely cooler than Mighty Man.

37
00:02:20.304 --> 00:02:26.615
Mighty Man is kind of . . . silly."

38
00:02:26.616 --> 00:02:31.941
The four friends got to Jack's house and went inside.

39
00:02:31.942 --> 00:02:35.842
Jack grabbed some snacks, and everyone flopped onto the sofa.

40
00:02:35.843 --> 00:02:37.667
Jack turned on the TV.

41
00:02:37.668 --> 00:02:39.821
But Mighty Man wasn't on.

42
00:02:39.822 --> 00:02:43.602
Instead a strange man was on the set of the TV show.

43
00:02:43.603 --> 00:02:47.126
He had a tall hat and a thin moustache.

44
00:02:47.127 --> 00:02:50.461
"Hello, everybody," said the man.

45
00:02:50.462 --> 00:02:52.723
"Mighty Man has been canceled.

46
00:02:52.724 --> 00:02:55.198
I have a new show for you.

47
00:02:55.199 --> 00:02:58.925
It's a magic show, and I'm the star!

48
00:02:58.926 --> 00:03:02.840
I'm going to be famous!"

49
00:03:02.841 --> 00:03:06.777
"Who is that guy?" asked Terrell.

50
00:03:06.778 --> 00:03:11.157
Roxy couldn't tell her friends, but she knew who the man was.

51
00:03:11.158 --> 00:03:16.408
"That's the evil magician Mr. Presto!" she thought.

52
00:03:16.409 --> 00:03:19.183
Roxy's watch beeped.

53
00:03:19.184 --> 00:03:26.185
She rushed into Jack's kitchen and pressed a button on the watch.

54
00:03:26.186 --> 00:03:29.057
"Rocket Girl!" said Mayor Bloom.

55
00:03:29.058 --> 00:03:32.615
"Mr. Presto took over the TV station!"

56
00:03:32.616 --> 00:03:35.089
"I know," Roxy whispered.

57
00:03:35.090 --> 00:03:40.991
"Don't worry. I'll stop him!"
